{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3205c15fb65fefda15b776f69ba8ba9b9980893567eba6f6686fd7c13d00a8ad", "ja": "（今日は水族館でPV撮影だ。休憩時間に館内を\n見学しているが……なんだか紬の圧を感じる）", "zh": "（今天要在水族馆拍摄PV。休息时间正在馆内参观，不过……总觉得能感受到紬带来的压迫感）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0cc6ed2b6b6c530f7ccd9c08fbeb8a786141733f3fbe15fdd1a457297e51dbf", "ja": "なあ、紬。何か言いたいことでもあるのか？\nさっきから見られてる気がするんだが……。", "zh": "喂，紬。你是不是有什么话想说？\n从刚才开始就感觉你一直在看我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "52aad14a491f58fe32551a02cf3dee803b1b7e8479ec9a261395b3529b4e5344", "ja": "っ……！！\nい、いつから気づいていたのですか！？", "zh": "啊……！！\n你、你是从什么时候发现的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6b6d789b52860338be5ef3a96bf1dd406ca2e2aed31955f4ccd6cefc780b394d", "ja": "前の水槽から、なんとなく……。\nもしかして、撮影がやりにくいのか？", "zh": "从之前那个水槽开始，就隐约察觉到了……  \n难道是觉得拍摄起来不太方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3698140bf399f45e32e81b2224ed4a208eaa3446defe587b105b96eb2beff7d3", "ja": "は？　撮影の始めからいたと思いましたが……\n貴方は一体、何を見ていたのですか？", "zh": "啊？我还以为您从拍摄一开始就在那儿……\n您究竟都看到了些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f4a770ecf7c9e1b9c81704cd02b7d71473865ffc161b7f66056eaa07381a9a6f", "ja": "スタッフの方々の丁寧な仕事ぶりは見ましたか？\nそれにとても親切で、やりにくいはずがありません。", "zh": "您看到工作人员认真细致的工作了吗？\n而且他们也非常亲切，合作起来不可能会有什么困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1007_p", "source_sha256": "25fccc2b32c7032e91664041a20b013f7ff4d061a0c52d477d9336ac7814c861", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nそれじゃ、何か悩み事か？", "zh": "原、原来如此……\n那么，是遇到什么烦恼了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f355991e2396dcb19a0ba1c3411bff49ea6860e72054f387b4b856bf519f9e6e", "ja": "開いた口がふさがらないとは、\nこういうことを言うのですね……。", "zh": "这下可真是目瞪口呆了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9004ddbac4a6330028ae9a9070303cce1dabdda31179e5a1100c092844cd1c07", "ja": "言葉にできないから視線を送っていたというのに、\nあえて言わせるなんて……貴方は鬼ですか？", "zh": "明明我是因为说不出口才一直看着您，您却偏要让我说出来……您是魔鬼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ad6bf939dba35a957e5c8b7ccca64f645eca019b7bd7aa83cc12bf8c2361dad9", "ja": "いや、無理に聞き出そうとしたわけじゃ……。\nそんなに言いにくいことだったんだな。", "zh": "不，我也不是想强行套你的话……\n原来是这么难以启齿的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c1303e99c1e71381a9f94c19304b22dbe6c6c5bdcb2396a5adeb432afbed742c", "ja": "あ、当たり前です。\nまだ心の準備ができていないので……。", "zh": "啊、那是当然的。\n因为我还没有做好心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1012_p", "source_sha256": "109c21cb89962b60fa0380df39e079dd0010f3c3425891720f24392a5a068281", "ja": "そ、そうか？　紬が話せると思ったら声をかけてくれ。\n言葉にしないと伝わらないこともあるからな。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？要是觉得能和纺聊聊，就叫我一声。\n因为有些事不说出来，是传达不到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8b5cf841624d8ef9bdf273b9e5dcc7561a92575af915452b6695f7de63358848", "ja": "ううっ。\nそれができたら、うちも困らんげん……。", "zh": "呜呜。\n要是能做到的话，我也就不用犯愁了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dd14e0fe711ece1e42cf529c50a499b26d1f562c31482e5a2c9b71fed537fb5b", "ja": "ん？　何か言ったか？", "zh": "嗯？你说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b0182a85f139ec011620667fdaabf09fea4856a3a79f9534b56d5b74ac145f60", "ja": "いえ、なんでもありません。\n今はこのままでいいと思っただけですから。", "zh": "不，没什么。\n只是觉得现在这样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1016_p", "source_sha256": "edf4710b7acabe228b33e1be02e234c08781366cb8f35f12c2f42bd14ee0ac57", "ja": "どういうことだ、紬？", "zh": "这是什么意思，紬？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "94eb6d1a9fea126d45b741aebd451dfed374f38e4b4035ee1de5b1f1e0a9ff80", "ja": "言葉にしろと言ったのは、貴方ではありませんか。\nだから私は、素直な気持ちを言ったまでです。", "zh": "不是您说要我说出来的吗？所以我只是把自己的真实感受说出来罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "54a6579a221cf279508be294ef638be4641c1ad2930d6e5496dc6e2723dadcc8", "ja": "わからないのであれば構いません。\nいつか、準備ができた時に聞いてもらいますから。", "zh": "听不明白就算了。\n等我什么时候准备好了，再让您听个明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2e3d17dac4de1cc992b6e8e6d48b012c1fdd84b39c137080867a7ff4cce85d35", "ja": "さあ、次の水槽へ参りましょう。\n休憩時間は長くはありませんからね。ふふっ。", "zh": "那么，我们去下一个水箱吧。\n休息时间可不长呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_051tmg0224_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_051tmg0224_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7385710e56e2ebcfde24449881ec1a372df4f17e8d3dd1dd5e3dc02316bda67e", "ja": "（その後の撮影も順調で、良いPVに仕上がりそうだ！\n……でもあの時、紬は何を言おうとしたんだろう？）", "zh": "（之后的拍摄也很顺利，看来能剪出一部很棒的PV！……不过那时候，紬到底想说什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
